{"page":48,"width":1862,"height":2468,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"과목 I 데이터 모델링의 이해","words":[{"text":"과목","x":168,"y":97,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"I","x":259,"y":98,"width":13,"height":30},{"text":"데이터","x":299,"y":96,"width":91,"height":31},{"text":"모델링의","x":408,"y":97,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"이해","x":542,"y":97,"width":56,"height":30}]},{"text":"속성의 이름을 부여할 때는 현업에서 사투는 이름을 부여하는 것이 가장 중요하다. 아무리 일반적인 용어라","words":[{"text":"속성의","x":255,"y":255,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"이름을","x":363,"y":255,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"부여할","x":466,"y":256,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"때는","x":567,"y":255,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"현업에서","x":638,"y":252,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"사투는","x":768,"y":251,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"이름을","x":896,"y":250,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"부여하는","x":993,"y":246,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"것이","x":1122,"y":246,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"가장","x":1193,"y":247,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"중요하다.","x":1265,"y":246,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"아무리","x":1405,"y":245,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"일반적인","x":1509,"y":245,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"용어라","x":1638,"y":243,"width":93,"height":37}]},{"text":"할지라도 그 업무에서 사용되지 않으면 속성의 명칭으로 사용하지 않는 것이 좋다.","words":[{"text":"할지라도","x":256,"y":309,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":400,"y":315,"width":32,"height":24},{"text":"업무에서","x":449,"y":310,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"사용되지","x":586,"y":309,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"않으면","x":722,"y":307,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"속성의","x":825,"y":305,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"명칭으로","x":930,"y":304,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"사용하지","x":1064,"y":302,"width":116,"height":37},{"text":"않는","x":1199,"y":303,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":1277,"y":302,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"좋다.","x":1353,"y":301,"width":69,"height":37}]},{"text":"일반적으로는 서술식의 속성명은 사용하지 밀이야 한다. 명사형을 이용하고 수식어가 많이 붙지 않도록","words":[{"text":"일반적으로는","x":261,"y":366,"width":192,"height":36},{"text":"서술식의","x":469,"y":365,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"속성명은","x":605,"y":364,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"사용하지","x":743,"y":361,"width":117,"height":38},{"text":"밀이야","x":879,"y":361,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":983,"y":360,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"명사형을","x":1070,"y":360,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"이용하고","x":1207,"y":358,"width":122,"height":38},{"text":"수식어가","x":1344,"y":358,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"많이","x":1484,"y":357,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"붙지","x":1561,"y":356,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"않도록","x":1638,"y":356,"width":94,"height":35}]},{"text":"유의하여 작성한다. 수식어가 많으면 의미 파악이 힘들고, 상세 설계 단계에서 물리속성으로 전환하는 데","words":[{"text":"유의하여","x":259,"y":422,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"작성한다.","x":405,"y":421,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"수식어가","x":552,"y":419,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"많으면","x":686,"y":419,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"의미","x":791,"y":418,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"파악이","x":864,"y":417,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"힘들고,","x":968,"y":417,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"상세","x":1081,"y":417,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"설계","x":1155,"y":416,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"단계에서","x":1230,"y":414,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"물리속성으로","x":1366,"y":414,"width":183,"height":36},{"text":"전환하는","x":1564,"y":412,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"데","x":1702,"y":412,"width":28,"height":34}]},{"text":"명확한 의미 파악이 어렵게 된다. 소유격도 사용하지 않는다.","words":[{"text":"명확한","x":259,"y":477,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"의미","x":373,"y":478,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"파악이","x":451,"y":477,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"어렵게","x":558,"y":475,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"된다.","x":664,"y":475,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"소유격도","x":749,"y":474,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"사용하지","x":886,"y":474,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"않는다.","x":1020,"y":473,"width":95,"height":36}]},{"text":"공용화되지 않은 업무에서 사용하지 않는 약어는 사용하지 않는 것이 좋다. 지나치게 약어를 많이 사용하면","words":[{"text":"공용화되지","x":255,"y":531,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"않은","x":428,"y":531,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"업무에서","x":502,"y":531,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"사용하지","x":633,"y":531,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"않는","x":766,"y":532,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"약어는","x":839,"y":530,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"사용하지","x":940,"y":529,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"않는","x":1070,"y":528,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":1144,"y":528,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"좋다.","x":1214,"y":528,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"지나치게","x":1297,"y":526,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"약어를","x":1430,"y":527,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"많이","x":1533,"y":524,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"사용하면","x":1608,"y":523,"width":122,"height":36}]},{"text":"업무 분석자 내에서도 의사소통이 제약을 받으며, 시스템을 운영할 때도 많은 불편을 초래할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"업무","x":257,"y":586,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"분석자","x":337,"y":585,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"내에서도","x":448,"y":586,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"의사소통이","x":584,"y":587,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"제약을","x":752,"y":586,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"받으며,","x":858,"y":586,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"시스템을","x":973,"y":585,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"운영할","x":1107,"y":584,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"때도","x":1213,"y":585,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":1289,"y":583,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"불편을","x":1364,"y":583,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"초래할","x":1471,"y":581,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1578,"y":581,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1627,"y":580,"width":69,"height":36}]},{"text":"가능하면 모든 속성의 이름은 유일하게 작성하는 것이 좋다. 물론 대량의 속성을 정의하는 경우 유일하게","words":[{"text":"가능하면","x":259,"y":640,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"모든","x":401,"y":643,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"속성의","x":477,"y":642,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"이름은","x":584,"y":643,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"유일하게","x":688,"y":642,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"작성하는","x":824,"y":642,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":958,"y":640,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"좋다.","x":1029,"y":640,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"물론","x":1113,"y":642,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"대량의","x":1188,"y":640,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"속성을","x":1291,"y":638,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"정의하는","x":1398,"y":638,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":1533,"y":637,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"유일하게","x":1606,"y":637,"width":122,"height":35}]},{"text":"작성하는 것이 어려울 수도 있지만, 이렇게 하는 것이 나수해 데이터에 대한 흐름을 파악하고 데이터의 정합성을","words":[{"text":"작성하는","x":260,"y":696,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"것이","x":395,"y":696,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"어려울","x":464,"y":698,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"수도","x":563,"y":700,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"있지만,","x":634,"y":699,"width":91,"height":39},{"text":"이렇게","x":740,"y":698,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"하는","x":836,"y":698,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"것이","x":907,"y":698,"width":52,"height":35},{"text":"나수해","x":974,"y":697,"width":81,"height":36},{"text":"데이터에","x":1069,"y":696,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"대한","x":1194,"y":697,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"흐름을","x":1263,"y":696,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"파악하고","x":1360,"y":694,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"데이터의","x":1487,"y":693,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"정합성을","x":1614,"y":693,"width":116,"height":35}]},{"text":"유지하는 데 큰 도움이 된다. 또한 반정규화(테이블통합, 분리, 칼럼의 중복 뉘를 적용할 때 속성명의 충돌","words":[{"text":"유지하는","x":262,"y":753,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"데","x":402,"y":753,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"큰","x":444,"y":757,"width":32,"height":32},{"text":"도움이","x":488,"y":756,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"된다.","x":592,"y":756,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"또한","x":675,"y":755,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"반정규화(테이블통합,","x":748,"y":753,"width":286,"height":39},{"text":"분리,","x":1048,"y":753,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"칼럼의","x":1131,"y":754,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"중복","x":1233,"y":753,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"뉘를","x":1306,"y":753,"width":72,"height":36},{"text":"적용할","x":1392,"y":751,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"때","x":1493,"y":751,"width":27,"height":33},{"text":"속성명의","x":1534,"y":749,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"충돌","x":1670,"y":749,"width":60,"height":33}]},{"text":"(Conflict)을 해결하여 안정적으로 반정규화를 적용할 수 있게 된다.","words":[{"text":"(Conflict)을","x":264,"y":813,"width":179,"height":38},{"text":"해결하여","x":459,"y":813,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"안정적으로","x":596,"y":814,"width":150,"height":35},{"text":"반정규화를","x":762,"y":811,"width":149,"height":36},{"text":"적용할","x":928,"y":810,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1031,"y":811,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"있게","x":1078,"y":810,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"된다.","x":1154,"y":810,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"52","words":[{"text":"52","x":220,"y":2381,"width":42,"height":31}]},{"text":"전문가 ,까드","words":[{"text":"전문가","x":348,"y":2379,"width":60,"height":28},{"text":",까드","x":417,"y":2378,"width":61,"height":27}]}]}